<title>FRANCE: GAN 1996 sales rise.</title>
<headline>GAN 1996 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					53,543    vs   51,886</p>
<p>    - Non Life France			   14,405    vs   14,547</p>
<p>    - life insurance and funds France     25,035    vs   22,864</p>
<p>    - GAN international			 14,103    vs   14,474</p>
<p>    FOURTH QUARTER				13,027    vs   14,646</p>
<p>    - Non Life France			    3,490    vs    3,807</p>
<p>    - Life insurance and funds France	6,441    vs    7,216</p>
<p>    - GAN international			  3,095    vs    3,624</p>
<p>NOTE - GAN gave the figures in the BALO official bulletin. It said the figures were provisional. It said twelve-month insurance sales were up 3.2 percent. At comparable structure sales rose 4.7 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
